"<font color=\"#00aa00\"><b>The Kat daemon is running</b></font>"
"<br>"
"<br>Our test reveals that the Kat daemon is running. Being this the first time "
"you run this version of Kat, we can be reasonably sure that the running daemon "
"comes from a previuos installation of Kat."
